check 1
# Buying from Akara through scripted C->S messages (`at … send`,
# specs/tools/scenario-diff.md §2, §3 rule 11): ScnBuy (ScnAma with 5000 gold:
# a buy without gold is refused, vendors.md §7.1 rule 4), -seed 1234, no input.
# Akara (monstats 148) stands at (4932, 4206) in this town; her room is not
# active from the start position, so the player is poked towards her in
# steps (each point inside a room already active), last to (4928, 4210),
# within the 0x13 start distance (world/npc.md §2 rule 4). Then the
# client's NPC flow, one message per frame: 0x13 interact (npc.md §2), 0x2F
# chat open (§3), 0x38 action 1 = trade (§4; the store is generated,
# world/vendors.md §3-§4), 0x32 buy of the first store item (vendors.md §7.1;
# the character has no items, so the first item unit in GUID order, @4, is
# the store's first item).
name items-vendor-akara-buy
save ScnBuy --class ama --expansion --gold 5000
seed 1234
ticks 40
seconds 300
channels state packets
at 4 poke pos @player 4888 4228
at 7 poke pos @player 4903 4224
at 10 poke pos @player 4918 4216
at 13 poke pos @player 4928 4210
at 16 send InteractWithEntity type=1 id=@1:148
at 18 send InitEntityChat id=@1:148
at 20 send EntityAction action=1 npc=@1:148 item=0
at 24 send BuyItem npc=@1:148 item=@4 transaction=0 client_price=0
